-                ImGui::TextWrapped("ID 0 is the fixed-center mono DuoView build: Native Fix left source is the high-resolution fovea, right capture is the low-resolution full-field periphery, and one composite is sent to both eyes.");
+                ImGui::TextWrapped("ID 0 uses the fixed-center mono DuoView source path. With Native Stereo Fix enabled, the left source is the high-resolution fovea and the separate right capture is the lower-resolution full-field periphery. With Native Fix disabled, both regions use the existing double-wide source. One composite is sent to both eyes.");
